{"id":"n64547-3-9","stage":2,"title":"따르다 · 跟上","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n64547-3-9-1","ko":"엄마가 하는 요리는 정말 맛있어요.","zh":"妈妈做的菜真的很好吃。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"엄마가","meaning":"妈妈","explanation":"엄마：妈妈；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67098","senseId":"2","lemma":"엄마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"엄마가","audio":"/audio/2e1aa7412bb8a19dded5.mp3"}},{"text":"하는","meaning":"做，作，置办","explanation":"하다：做，作，置办；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"2","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하는","audio":"/audio/db405bc1ba8346522533.mp3"}},{"text":"요리는","meaning":"菜，菜肴，料理","explanation":"요리：菜，菜肴，料理；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"요리","audio":"/audio/aa664b105a07ea19ff3e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30199","senseId":"2","lemma":"요리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"요리는","audio":"/audio/45711fd5d1fa96097795.mp3"}},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的。","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61174","senseId":"1","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}},{"text":"맛있어요.","meaning":"好吃，可口，香","explanation":"맛있다：好吃，可口，香；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"맛있다","audio":"/audio/21e91ac8a208ff9e520a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70811","senseId":"1","lemma":"맛있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맛있어요","audio":"/audio/d2df2197e887a0da537c.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"9498f9014908e289","term":"엄마","zh":"妈妈","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3","entryId":"67098","definition":"主要加在子女名字后面，在与子女有关的事情上用于指称或称呼有子女的女性。","pronunciation":["엄마"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，作，置办","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"制作或准备什么东西。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"aa664b105a07ea19","term":"요리","zh":"菜，菜肴，料理","audio":"/audio/aa664b105a07ea19ff3e.mp3","entryId":"30199","definition":"经过烹调好的食物。","pronunciation":["요리"]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61174","definition":"没有虚假而真正地。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"21e91ac8a208ff9e","term":"맛있다","zh":"好吃，可口，香","audio":"/audio/21e91ac8a208ff9e520a.mp3","entryId":"70811","definition":"食物的味道好。","pronunciation":["마딛따","마싣따"]}],"audio":"/audio/0fb60ab69f3686526ef1.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n64547-3-9-2","ko":"요리로는 이 동네에서 나를 따를 주부가 없지.","zh":"就做饭而言，这附近没人能比我更厉害。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"요리로는","meaning":"烹饪，烹调","explanation":"요리：烹饪，烹调；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"요리","audio":"/audio/aa664b105a07ea19ff3e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30199","senseId":"1","lemma":"요리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"요리로는","audio":"/audio/e332a1fb350aad049f03.mp3"}},{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个。","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"동네에서","meaning":"小区，社区，村庄","explanation":"동네：小区，社区，村庄；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"동네","audio":"/audio/f97ccdfe641c28373e6c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62417","senseId":"2","lemma":"동네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"동네에서","audio":"/audio/9b5567575ddda2bf9fb0.mp3"}},{"text":"나를","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나를","audio":"/audio/4225b1c78642e45b4068.mp3"}},{"text":"따를","meaning":"跟上","explanation":"따르다：跟上；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"따르다","audio":"/audio/3ad4e3c6c1e70deec620.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64547","senseId":"3","lemma":"따르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"따를","audio":"/audio/ac3d4c384ed9e5b30c17.mp3"}},{"text":"주부가","meaning":"主妇，家庭主妇","explanation":"주부：主妇，家庭主妇；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"주부","audio":"/audio/1f83acecf58b7ec33dbe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91769","senseId":"1","lemma":"주부","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주부가","audio":"/audio/d6b705c5033a012b0934.mp3"}},{"text":"없지.","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"1","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없지","audio":"/audio/1d76091ae1eea6a08772.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"aa664b105a07ea19","term":"요리","zh":"烹饪，烹调","audio":"/audio/aa664b105a07ea19ff3e.mp3","entryId":"30199","definition":"烹制食物的事。","pronunciation":["요리"]},{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"f97ccdfe641c2837","term":"동네","zh":"小区，社区，村庄","audio":"/audio/f97ccdfe641c28373e6c.mp3","entryId":"62417","definition":"多户人家聚集在一起生活的地方。","pronunciation":["동ː네"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"3ad4e3c6c1e70dee","term":"따르다","zh":"跟上","audio":"/audio/3ad4e3c6c1e70deec620.mp3","entryId":"64547","definition":"达到有相对较高水平的对象的同样水准。","pronunciation":["따르다"]},{"id":"1f83acecf58b7ec3","term":"주부","zh":"主妇，家庭主妇","audio":"/audio/1f83acecf58b7ec33dbe.mp3","entryId